j39_a_handler_that_answers_no_response.co:5:5: echo[] answers a JSON value, not a response: a route's handler returns text[…], html[…], json[…], respond[…], redirect[…], bytes[…], msgpack[…], arrow[…] or stream[…] — json[…] of text parses it, and json[…] of what it parsed answers it: json[json[text]]
  5 │     return json[req.body]
    │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
